Source: koompi-boot-success
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: KOOMPI <packages@koompi.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: koompi-boot-success
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: clears the boot-fallback flag once graphical.target is reached
 koompi-boot-success.service runs once graphical.target is reached and
 unsets koompi_boot_pending/koompi_pending_snapshot in grubenv, the other
 half of the boot-success auto-fallback GRUB reads at the next boot (see
 docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §5).
